<title>FRANCE: Pernod cautiously confident on 1997.</title>
<headline>Pernod cautiously confident on 1997.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-03-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Pernod Ricard chairman Patrick Ricard said on Wednesday that he was both cautious and confident in his outlook for this year.</p>
<p>Pernod earlier reported a 7.9 percent rise in 1996 net attributable profit to 1.19 billion francs.</p>
<p>&quot;In an improving economic context, notably in Europe, 1997 will also be characterized for Pernod by the negative impact of overstocking in France of wine and spirits at the end of 1996,&quot; ahead of a tax increase that went into effect on January 1, Ricard told a news conference.  He declined to give a forecast.</p>
<p>((-- Paris Newsroom, +33 1 4221 5452))</p>
